{% extends "layout/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="dest-page-hero" id="top">

  <div class="dest-page-hero__img">
    <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="dest-page-hero__overlay"></div>

  <nav class="dest-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <div class="dest-breadcrumb__inner">
      <a href="/" class="dest-breadcrumb__link">Home</a>
      <span class="dest-breadcrumb__sep">&rsaquo;</span>
      <span class="dest-breadcrumb__current">Royal Caribbean</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="dest-page-hero__content">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">Royal Caribbean</p>
    <h1 class="dest-page-hero__headline">
      The world's greatest<br>
      cruise line, from someone<br>
      who's <em>sailed it.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="dest-page-hero__sub">
      Caribbean islands, Alaskan glaciers, Bermuda — I've sailed Royal Caribbean in interior cabins and on the balcony, with young kids, with teenagers, and as a couple. My recommendations come from being there.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="btn btn--gold" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Start Your Escape
    </a>
  </div>

</section>

<!-- Personal Story -->
<section class="dest-story" id="our-experience">
  <div class="dest-story__inner">

    <div class="dest-story__text reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Our Experience</p>
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">
        Three oceans.<br>
        Every kind of <em>traveler.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        Royal Caribbean is the cruise line I recommend to first-timers because the ships have something for everyone and the value is genuinely hard to beat. I've sailed the Caribbean with young kids, navigated Alaska with teenagers, and explored Bermuda as a couple. Each trip taught me something different about how to make the most of it.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        What surprises most first-timers is how much the ship itself matters. The right itinerary on the wrong ship — or the wrong cabin category for your family's style — can change everything. I've made those mistakes so you don't have to.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        Whether you're a family looking for your first cruise or a couple chasing something more adventurous, I'll match you to the ship, itinerary, and experience that actually fits your life.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-story__photo reveal">
      <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Chuck's family on a Royal Caribbean cruise"></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Insider Tips -->
<section class="dest-tips" id="tips">
  <div class="dest-tips__inner">

    <div class="dest-tips__header reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">What I've Learned</p>
      <h2 class="dest-tips__headline">
        Insider tips from<br>
        someone who's <em>sailed it.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-tips__grid">

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Interior Cabins Are Not a Compromise</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">In the Caribbean, you're off the ship from 8am to 6pm every port day. The cabin is for sleeping. Save the money for excursions and specialty dining — that's where the real memories are made.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">The Dining Package Math Rarely Works Out</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Specialty restaurants are genuinely great, but the main dining room is better than you'd expect. Buy one or two specialty dinners à la carte rather than committing to a package — you'll likely spend less and enjoy it more.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Book Excursions Early — the Right Ones</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Third-party excursions can run 40–60% cheaper than ship-booked ones for the same experience. I know which operators are reliable at which ports, and which ship excursions are worth the premium for the peace of mind.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">04</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Sea Days Are the Hidden Gem</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">First-timers often dread sea days. They end up being everyone's favorite. The ship comes alive, crowds thin at the pools by mid-morning, and it's the most genuinely relaxing day of the entire trip.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">05</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Run the Beverage Package Math Honestly</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">The package breaks even at roughly five to six drinks per person per day. Do the math for your family before buying it. If you're not drinkers, skip it. If you are, it's usually worth it — especially in Alaska where you're indoors more.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dest-tip reveal">
        <span class="dest-tip__num">06</span>
        <h3 class="dest-tip__title">Ship Selection Matters as Much as Itinerary</h3>
        <p class="dest-tip__body">Wonder of the Seas in the Mediterranean is a fundamentally different experience than Anthem of the Seas in the Bahamas. I'll match you to the right ship for your family's priorities — not just the cheapest fare on the right dates.</p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Gallery -->
<section class="dest-gallery" id="gallery">
  <div class="dest-gallery__inner">

    <div class="dest-gallery__header reveal">
      <h2 class="dest-gallery__headline">Our Memories</h2>
      <p class="dest-gallery__note">Photos coming soon</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dest-gallery__grid">
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Royal Caribbean photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Royal Caribbean photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Royal Caribbean photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Royal Caribbean photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="dest-gallery__item">
        <div class="photo-placeholder" aria-label="Royal Caribbean photo coming soon"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-strip.njk" %}

{% endblock %}
